{"rev":19,"xml":"<doc node='6239a985-a932' rev='19'><paragraph id='mje9hk5kec2.0' rev='1' h='ce7d5d35' heading='1'><text id='.1'>Template Crewship Docs</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.23' h='588da410'><date id='.24' value='2026-11-07'/><text id='.25'> · </text><mention id='.28' user='u_aKNBxNzGVh63xrJcl4Ek0w' name='Pavel' self='true'/></paragraph><paragraph id='.32' rev='2' h='9ed9f581' heading='2'><text id='.33'>Co je Crewship</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.47' h='0f0dfee6'><text id='.48'>Crewship je platforma, kde tým AI agentů (crew) dostane úkol, rozdělí si práci a doručí výsledek přes jedno CLI a webové rozhraní. Tento dokument je testovací šablona: ukazuje, co umí Claude Docs.</text></paragraph><list id='.244' h='9fc5dff7' kind='bullet'><listItem id='.245' h='41b7c163'><paragraph id='.246' h='b16272f2'><text id='.247'><bold>Pro koho:</bold></text><text id='.256'> týmy, které chtějí delegovat opakovanou práci na agenty.</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.313' h='f12eae91'><paragraph id='.314' h='edd29512'><text id='.315'><bold>Jak:</bold></text><text id='.319'> crew = sada agentů s rolemi; každý endpoint má CLI příkaz.</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.378' h='a512b05c'><paragraph id='.379' h='17b0ac60'><text id='.380'><bold>Kde:</bold></text><text id='.384'> dev prostředí dev1–dev4, stage jako canary.</text></paragraph></listItem></list><paragraph id='.428' rev='3' h='83a35e5f' heading='2'><text id='.429'>Ukázka funkcí dokumentu</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.452' h='e7efd85e'><text id='.453'>Tabulka níže je živá: buňky se píšou přímo, sloupec Stav je dropdown a ke každé buňce jde přidat komentář.</text></paragraph><table id='.559' h='31d472fd'><row id='.560' h='541d44cd'><cell id='.561' h='5c3e6ad5' header='true'><paragraph id='.562' h='070e2161'><text id='.563'>Typ artefaktu</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.576' h='9152aff5' header='true'><paragraph id='.577' h='bce0d49b'><text id='.578'>Co umí</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.584' h='087a8a3a' header='true'><paragraph id='.585' h='d6c4540c'><text id='.586'>Stav</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.590' h='2fe3618d'><cell id='.591' h='7af54f04'><paragraph id='.592' h='7af023c4'><text id='.593'>Docs</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.597' h='25cb796a'><paragraph id='.598' h='453a5ad1'><text id='.599'>Editace, komentáře, export .docx / PDF / Markdown</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.648' h='f71c2e60'><paragraph id='.649' h='d50e2153'><dropdown id='.650' enum='b5bccc3d-6896' index='0'>Hotovo</dropdown></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.651' h='8e7be200'><cell id='.652' h='d7f306e2'><paragraph id='.653' h='a0ffe381'><text id='.654'>Slides</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.660' h='a7713ddc'><paragraph id='.661' h='b608e1c8'><text id='.662'>16:9 prezentace, export .pptx / PDF</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.697' h='3800e4cd'><paragraph id='.698' h='d50e2153'><dropdown id='.699' enum='b5bccc3d-6896' index='0'>Hotovo</dropdown></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.700' h='1ec8d2c6'><cell id='.701' h='f6fd30f7'><paragraph id='.702' h='67b69646'><text id='.703'>Dashboard</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.712' h='0515af26'><paragraph id='.713' h='c22e4ea5'><text id='.714'>Grafy, KPI, filtry, zdroj u každého čísla</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.755' h='8961e58c'><paragraph id='.756' h='ffe72268'><dropdown id='.757' enum='b5bccc3d-6896' index='1'>Rozpracováno</dropdown></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.758' h='c9b5c1ae'><cell id='.759' h='66fec8e0'><paragraph id='.760' h='0072e6b9'><text id='.761'>Design</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.767' h='b38aad70'><paragraph id='.768' h='ea75bece'><text id='.769'>Plátno s artboardy, mockupy obrazovek</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.806' h='c55b6896'><paragraph id='.807' h='881379f1'><dropdown id='.808' enum='b5bccc3d-6896' index='2'>Napánováno</dropdown></paragraph></cell></row></table><paragraph id='.809' h='2a4c9fdd'><text id='.810'>Checklist s termínem </text><date id='.831' value='2026-11-20'/><text id='.832'> – položky jdou odškrtávat:</text></paragraph><list id='.859' h='d9d7d272' kind='check'><listItem id='.860' h='717cc42e' checked='true'><paragraph id='.861' h='9a9b133a'><text id='.862'>Založit Template Crewship Docs</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.892' h='bf4f9e04'><paragraph id='.893' h='9ceb689f'><text id='.894'>Projet export do PDF</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.914' h='9d48c891'><paragraph id='.915' h='5e763d77'><text id='.916'>Pozvat kolegu ke komentářům</text></paragraph></listItem></list><paragraph id='.943' h='42b3759b'><text id='.944'>Vzorec se vykreslí jako LaTeX:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.974' h='4e19fc39' language='latex'><text id='.975'><![CDATA[\\text{náklad crew} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\text{tokeny}_i \\times \\text{cena}_i]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.1047' rev='4' h='9a464a81' heading='2'><text id='.1048'>Diagram a graf</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1062' h='3eb7a215'><text id='.1063'>Diagram i graf jsou živé: popisky jde přepsat přímo v obrázku a na každý box nebo sloupec jde napsat komentář.</text></paragraph><embed id='.1173' h='6ead73d7' caption='tok práce v Crewship · 4 kroky' ref='node/8b77865d-4f22'/><embed id='.1174' h='d8b0bb52' caption='testovací data zadaná v chatu · 6 týdnů' ref='node/67f94a98-44a1'/><paragraph id='.1175' h='d310b5c8'><text id='.1176'>Na sloupec najedíš myší a uvidíš hodnotu; graf se překreslí, když se změní jeho řádky dat.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1345' rev='6' h='2fd103fe' heading='2'><text id='.1346'>Formátování textu</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1363' h='6439427d'><text id='.1364'>Text umí </text><text id='.1373'><bold>tučné</bold></text><text id='.1378'>, </text><text id='.1380'><italic>kurzívu</italic></text><text id='.1387'>, </text><text id='.1389'><strike>přeškrtnutí</strike></text><text id='.1400'>, </text><text id='.1402'><italic><bold>kombinaci</bold></italic></text><text id='.1411'>, </text><text id='.1413'><code>inline kód</code></text><text id='.1423'> jako </text><text id='.1429'><code>crew ls</code></text><text id='.1436'> a </text><text id='.1439'><link href='https://claude.ai'>odkaz na web</link></text><text id='.1451'>. Vše jde měnit i z panelu nad označeným textem.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1499' h='17e15a77' heading='3'><text id='.1500'>Nadpis třetí úrovně</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1519' h='cbdfba0a'><text id='.1520'>Nadpisy tvoří strukturu dokumentu; podle nich se dá skákat odkazem (viz sekce Záložky a odkazy).</text></paragraph><blockquote id='.1616' h='fb652ad7'><paragraph id='.1617' h='5a5663a2'><text id='.1618'>Citace: „Crew je tým agentů, který dostane úkol a dodá výsledek.“ Hodí se na výroky zákazníků nebo zadání.</text></paragraph></blockquote><paragraph id='.1724' rev='7' h='c9bdd5ca' heading='2'><text id='.1725'>Seznamy</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1732' h='308e0293'><text id='.1733'>Číslovaný seznam s vnořenými body; položky jde přetažením přeřadit a čísla se přepočítají sama.</text></paragraph><list id='.1828' h='6d9cfa77' kind='ordered'><listItem id='.1829' h='931c36ce'><paragraph id='.1830' h='a8cc69c6'><text id='.1831'>Založ crew</text></paragraph><list id='.1841' h='8aae6f2d' kind='ordered'><listItem id='.1842' h='102cfc5a'><paragraph id='.1843' h='08ef6548'><text id='.1844'>Vyber šablonu</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.1857' h='e30ffb02'><paragraph id='.1858' h='efff248c'><text id='.1859'>Přid</text><comment id='0e9b230e-b6c2'/><text id='.1863'>ej agenty a role</text></paragraph></listItem></list></listItem><listItem id='.1879' h='89bf4792'><paragraph id='.1880' h='72754f7b'><comment id='0e9b230e-b6c2'/><text id='.1881'>Zadej úkol</text></paragraph><list id='.1891' h='92ee55c4' kind='bullet'><listItem id='.1892' h='75d0e2d7'><paragraph id='.1893' h='52850bd9'><comment id='0e9b230e-b6c2'/><text id='.1894'>Popis a termín</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.1908' h='4fa2154e'><paragraph id='.1909' h='4ec901a6'><text id='.1910'>Přílohy a odkazy</text></paragraph></listItem></list></listItem><listItem id='.1926' h='8aacb5b4'><paragraph id='.1927' h='f2802c54'><text id='.1928'>Zkontroluj výsledek</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='.1947' h='6177696c'><paragraph id='.1948' h='f87c138d'><text id='.1949'>Pošli report týmu</text></paragraph></listItem></list><paragraph id='.1966' rev='8' h='73848840' heading='2'><comment id='d016e513-eba7'/><text id='.1967'>Bloky kódu</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1977' h='5ab14be6'><text id='.1978'>Kód má zvýrazněnou syntaxi podle jazyka a tlačítko pro kopírování. Ukázky níže jsou vymyšlené a slouží jen pro test.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.2094' h='a772a03d'><text id='.2095'>Python:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.2102' h='edce1e01' language='python'><text id='.2103'><![CDATA[from dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass Task:\n    crew: str\n    done: int\n    failed: int\n\n    @property\n    def success_rate(self) -> float:\n        total = self.done + self.failed\n        return self.done / total if total else 0.0\n\nprint(f\"{Task('Support', 42, 3).success_rate:.0%}\")  # 93%]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.2407' h='e8be87a0'><text id='.2408'>Go:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.2411' h='c34a8e6b' language='go'><text id='.2412'><![CDATA[package main\n\nimport \"fmt\"\n\ntype Task struct {\n\tCrew   string\n\tDone   int\n\tFailed int\n}\n\nfunc (t Task) SuccessRate() float64 {\n\ttotal := t.Done + t.Failed\n\tif total == 0 {\n\t\treturn 0\n\t}\n\treturn float64(t.Done) / float64(total)\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n\tfmt.Printf(\"%.0f%%\\n\", Task{\"Support\", 42, 3}.SuccessRate()*100)\n}]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.2723' h='a36bcf2e'><text id='.2724'>TypeScript:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.2735' h='68521627' language='typescript'><text id='.2736'><![CDATA[type Task = { crew: string; done: number; failed: number };\n\nconst successRate = (t: Task): number =>\n  t.done + t.failed === 0 ? 0 : t.done / (t.done + t.failed);]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.2899' h='eb1e2728'><text id='.2900'>Bash:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.2905' h='9acbaaca' language='bash'><text id='.2906'><![CDATA[export CREWSHIP_SERVER=http://localhost:8081\ncrewship crew list --output json | jq '.[].name']]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.2999' h='3cba71b6'><text id='.3000'>SQL:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.3004' h='30b94371' language='sql'><text id='.3005'><![CDATA[SELECT crew, SUM(done) AS done, SUM(failed) AS failed\nFROM crew_tasks\nWHERE week >= '2026-10-01'\nGROUP BY crew\nORDER BY done DESC;]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.3135' h='0fbb96f1'><text id='.3136'>JSON:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.3141' h='d8bcde19' language='json'><text id='.3142'><![CDATA[{ \"crew\": \"Support\", \"done\": 42, \"failed\": 3, \"cost_usd\": 18.4 }]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.3206' h='2e4297d1'><text id='.3207'>YAML:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.3212' h='fdee0cbc' language='yaml'><text id='.3213'><![CDATA[crew:\n  name: Support\n  agents:\n    - role: triage\n    - role: writer]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.3282' rev='9' h='7ebda6cf' heading='2'><text id='.3283'>CSV a Markdown ukázky</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.3304' h='4d3fb000'><comment id='5ba58d78-9568'/><text id='.3305'>Blok CSV se zobrazí jako mřížka jen pro čtení, ale text pod ním jde upravit a zkopírovat.</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.3394' h='c43d67f1' language='csv'><text id='.3395'><![CDATA[week,crew,done,failed,cost_usd\n2026-W40,Support,38,4,16.20\n2026-W40,Research,21,2,24.80\n2026-W41,Support,42,3,18.40\n2026-W41,Research,25,1,27.10]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.3539' h='01f55305'><text id='.3540'>Blok Markdown se vykreslí jako hotový text, třeba šablona changelogu:</text></paragraph><codeBlock id='.3609' h='3e69743b' language='markdown'><text id='.3610'><![CDATA[### v1.4.0 (2026-11-07)\n\n- **Nové:** filtr crew v dashboardu\n- **Opraveno:** export CSV s diakritikou]]></text></codeBlock><paragraph id='.3711' rev='10' h='c3aa6a86' heading='2'><text id='.3712'>Tabulka s barvami a odkazy</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.3738' h='e2794cc9'><text id='.3739'>Buňky jde podbarvit jednou ze sedmi barev editoru; odkaz v buňce vede rovnou na další artefakt.</text></paragraph><table id='.3834' rev='17' h='be2663ca'><row id='.3835' h='683273bb'><cell id='.3836' rev='15' h='fa5b20dd' background='#e7f1fb' header='true'><paragraph id='.3837' rev='10' h='545dc1ab'><text id='.3838'>Artefakt</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3846' rev='16' h='072a96ac' background='#e7f1fb' header='true'><paragraph id='.3847' rev='10' h='59a19de6'><text id='.3848'>Co ukazuje</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3858' rev='17' h='ba9570a0' background='#e7f1fb' header='true'><paragraph id='.3859' rev='10' h='d6c4540c'><text id='.3860'>Stav</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.3864' rev='11' h='9470d7a6'><cell id='.3865' rev='10' h='024db101'><paragraph id='.3866' h='a0ffe381'><text id='.3867'><link href='https://claude.ai/artifact/CBBoNZhbaHvUUUz2aQ2Ccv'>Slides</link></text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3873' h='9392a60d'><paragraph id='.3874' h='335dce65'><text id='.3875'>prezentace, animace, export .pptx</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3908' rev='11' h='bf22233c' background='#e5f4e4'><paragraph id='.3909' rev='10' h='189722e5'><text id='.3910'>Hotovo</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.3916' rev='12' h='73bb09c2'><cell id='.3917' rev='10' h='c6d77bc5'><paragraph id='.3918' h='67b69646'><text id='.3919'><link href='https://claude.ai/artifact/RwrX5Qdjw7zLHdvxjEABKL'>Dashboard</link></text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3928' h='4caaf43c'><paragraph id='.3929' h='7bc9ad24'><text id='.3930'>KPI, filtry, CSV</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3946' rev='12' h='c5484f21' background='#f9eeda'><paragraph id='.3947' rev='10' h='5e7a0226'><text id='.3948'>Ke kontrole</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.3959' rev='13' h='0453ee9e'><cell id='.3960' rev='10' h='3216b02b'><paragraph id='.3961' h='0072e6b9'><text id='.3962'><link href='https://claude.ai/artifact/NwPV8rqSjHWDtpZPYUb2ko'>Design</link></text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3968' h='70061c3a'><paragraph id='.3969' h='085f2a61'><text id='.3970'>klikací mockup, paleta</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.3992' rev='13' h='edaff27e' background='#e5f4e4'><paragraph id='.3993' rev='10' h='189722e5'><text id='.3994'>Hotovo</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.4000' rev='14' h='306cdd81'><cell id='.4001' rev='10' h='1f6b2ea5'><paragraph id='.4002' h='9a15dc9c'><text id='.4003'><link href='https://claude.ai/artifact/E8HYX1pSVKSAbLqgvTCZ8Z'>Showcase</link></text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.4011' h='1381bdf8'><paragraph id='.4012' h='4e331147'><text id='.4013'>3D, Mermaid, e-mail</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.4032' rev='14' h='964b0338' background='#f9ece7'><paragraph id='.4033' rev='10' h='0a6c12b5'><text id='.4034'>Rozpracováno</text></paragraph></cell></row></table><paragraph id='.4046' rev='18' h='03c6773b' heading='2'><text id='.4047'>Záložky a odkazy</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.4063' rev='19' h='65d09a46'><text id='.4064'>Dokument má záložky </text><text id='.4250'>vlevo vedle textu, jako listy v Excelu (na telefonu v menu)</text><text id='.4110'>. Pracovní poznámky jsou na druhé záložce: </text><mention id='.4153' ref='file/b8dc5447-ba4a' label='Poznámky'/></paragraph><paragraph id='.4154' rev='18' h='e7facf60'><text id='.4155'>Odkaz umí skočit i na sekci ve stejném dokumentu: </text><text id='.4205'><link href='#mje9hk5kec2.1345'>zpět na Formátování textu</link></text><text id='.4230'> nebo </text><text id='.4236'><link href='#mje9hk5kec2.1966'>na Bloky kódu</link></text><text id='.4249'>.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1266' rev='4' h='8805daf0' heading='2'><text id='.1267'>Otevřené otázky</text></paragraph><list id='.1282' h='179f766e' kind='check'><listItem id='.1283' h='79d4ed2a'><paragraph id='.1284' h='4afc029f'><text id='.1285'>Které šablony chceme používat týmově? (napiš komentář)</text></paragraph></listItem></list></doc>"}
